guide forever/collectibles/mounts/alliance/paladin-charger
title Paladin Charger
category Class
folder Paladin
keywords Summon Charger, Lord Grayson Shadowbreaker, Emphasis on Sacrifice, Exorcising Terrordale, Grimand Elmore, Collection of Goods, Arcanite Barding, Ancient Equine Spirit, Manna-Enriched Horse Feed, Divination Scryer, Judgment and Redemption, Darkreaver, Dire Maul, Scholomance, Paladin, class mount
reward spell 23214 "Summon Charger"
why Your epic mount at 60, summoned at will: the faster step up from the Warhorse.
faction Alliance
class Paladin
levels 60-60
zone Stormwind City

# Summon Charger for Alliance Paladins: the whole chain, from the trainer's
# hand-off to Darkreaver's Fallen Charger in Scholomance.
# Sources: Forever client 1.60.1.70338 tables via wago.tools (Mount: the spell
# is still a Forever mount; ItemSparse); quests.json and npcs.json for the
# chain.
# The chain, from quests.json and data/forever/codex/quests.json: Lord Grayson
# Shadowbreaker (7638 from Duthorian Rall in Stormwind, or 7670 from Brandur
# Ironhammer in Ironforge; they exclude each other) -> Emphasis on Sacrifice
# (7637: High Priest Rohan's Exorcism Censer in Ironforge, a 150 gold
# donation) -> To Show Due Judgment (7639) -> Exorcising Terrordale (7640: 25
# Terrordale Spirits with the Exorcism Censer) -> The Work of Grimand Elmore
# (7641) -> Collection of Goods (7642: 40 Runecloth, 6 Arcanite Bars, 10
# Arthas' Tears, 5 Stratholme Holy Water and 150 gold) -> Grimand's Finest
# Work (7648: the Arcanite Barding to Lord Grayson) -> Ancient Equine Spirit
# (7643, with Manna-Enriched Horse Feed 7645: 20 Enriched Manna Biscuits and
# 50 gold for Merideth Carlson in Southshore; Tendris Warpwood in Dire Maul
# frees the spirit) -> Blessed Arcanite Barding (7644) -> The Divination
# Scryer (7646: an Azerothian Diamond and a Pristine Black Diamond) ->
# Judgment and Redemption (7647: the Divination Scryer in the Great Ossuary of
# Scholomance, Death Knight Darkreaver, the Charger's Redeemed Soul) ->
# Summon Charger.
# quests.json gives The Work of Grimand Elmore (7641) and Ancient Equine
# Spirit (7643) no `pre`; the codex has them after Exorcising Terrordale
# (7640) and Collection of Goods (7642), and the story (Lord Grayson sends
# you on after each) and Wowhead's series put them after 7640 and Grimand's
# Finest Work (7648). This guide follows that order.
# Again Into the Great Ossuary (7666, repeatable, a new Divination Scryer) is
# only named in a tip: the data lists it after Judgment and Redemption, and
# it only matters when an attempt at Darkreaver fails.
# Places: npcs.json for the givers and the Terrordale Spirits;
# items.json for the vendors of the Enriched Manna Biscuits (the Argent Dawn
# quartermasters), the Stratholme Supply Crates that hold the Holy Water and
# the droppers of the diamonds; tools/lib/codex/entrances.json (QuestieDB
# Forever) for the Dire Maul gate (Feralas 59.2,45.1), Scholomance (Caer
# Darrow, Western Plaguelands 69.7,73.2) and Stratholme's main gate (Eastern
# Plaguelands 26.5,10.4, Forever's map). Tendris Warpwood, the Ancient Equine
# Spirit, Darkreaver and his Fallen Charger have no spawns in our data (they
# are inside the dungeons): their goals point at the entrances.
# The Arcanite Bars point at Stormwind's auctioneers (npcs.json, Auctioneer
# Fitch, 61.2,71.3), the biscuits at Argent Quartermaster Lightspark in
# Chillwind Camp; classicdb.ch's item page (classicdb.ch/?item=13724) for the
# biscuits being sold in fives from Friendly with the Argent Dawn.
# Dungeon work: Stratholme, Dire Maul and Scholomance, groups of five at 60.
# Forever's Forsaken Paladins get the Forsaken Charger from their own quest
# (Justice and Retribution); it is not in our data yet: quests.json has no
# Horde Charger chain, so this guide stays Alliance.
# Based on data, not play: the beta caps at level 30 until launch on
# 4 November.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Lord Grayson Shadowbreaker

step Lord Grayson Shadowbreaker (Ironforge)
  only Dwarf
  zone Ironforge
  tip At 60 Brandur Ironhammer in the Mystic Ward sends you to Lord Grayson Shadowbreaker in Stormwind's Cathedral of Light.
  level 60
  accept 7670

step Lord Grayson Shadowbreaker
  zone Stormwind City
  tip The Summon Charger chain is long: it takes you through Stratholme, Dire Maul and Scholomance, and costs about 350 gold in donations on top of the materials. Lord Grayson stands in the Cathedral of Light.
  level 60
  accept 7638 only Human              -- Duthorian Rall, Cathedral of Light
  turnin 7638 only Human
  turnin 7670 only Dwarf
  accept 7637

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The Exorcism Censer

step High Priest Rohan
  zone Ironforge
  tip High Priest Rohan is in Ironforge's Mystic Ward. Bring 150 gold: the censer is yours for a donation.
  turnin 7637                         -- High Priest Rohan: 150 gold
  accept 7639

step Back to Lord Grayson
  zone Stormwind City
  turnin 7639                         -- Lord Grayson Shadowbreaker
  accept 7640

step Exorcising Terrordale
  zone Eastern Plaguelands
  tip Terrordale lies in the far north-west of the Eastern Plaguelands, by the Western Plaguelands border. Use the Exorcism Censer there to drive out the spirits, then defeat them.
  kill 14564 quest 7640.1             -- Terrordale Spirits

step Lord Grayson Shadowbreaker
  zone Stormwind City
  turnin 7640                         -- Lord Grayson Shadowbreaker
  accept 7641

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The Arcanite Barding

step Grimand Elmore
  tip Grimand Elmore works in Stormwind's Dwarven District.
  turnin 7641                         -- Grimand Elmore
  accept 7642

step Grimand's materials
  tip Runecloth drops from humanoids around level 50 and up; Arthas' Tears is an herb of the Plaguelands and Felwood; Arcanite Bars are an Alchemy transmute. The Auction House in Stormwind's Trade District sells all three, and so do crafters.
  collect 14047 quest 7642.3 @61.2,71.3 live -- Runecloth
  collect 8836 quest 7642.2           -- Arthas' Tears
  collect 12360 quest 7642.4 @61.2,71.3 live -- Arcanite Bars: the Auction House

step Stratholme Holy Water
  zone Eastern Plaguelands
  tip Stratholme is a group of five, level 58-60, at the north end of the Eastern Plaguelands. The Supply Crates scattered through the city hold the Stratholme Holy Water.
  goto 26.5,10.4 live "Stratholme"
  collect 13180 quest 7642.1 @26.5,10.4 live -- Supply Crates, inside

step Grimand Elmore
  zone Stormwind City
  tip Bring 150 gold for Grimand along with the materials.
  turnin 7642                         -- Grimand Elmore: 150 gold
  accept 7648

step Lord Grayson Shadowbreaker
  turnin 7648                         -- Lord Grayson Shadowbreaker: the Arcanite Barding
  accept 7643

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The Ancient Equine Spirit

step Enriched Manna Biscuits
  zone Western Plaguelands
  tip The Argent Dawn quartermasters sell the biscuits in fives once the Argent Dawn is Friendly with you: Argent Quartermaster Lightspark at Chillwind Camp, Quartermaster Miranda Breechlock at Light's Hope Chapel, Argent Quartermaster Hasana at the Bulwark.
  buy 13724 x20 npc 10857             -- Enriched Manna Biscuits: Argent Quartermaster Lightspark, Chillwind Camp

step Merideth Carlson
  zone Hillsbrad Foothills
  tip Merideth Carlson breeds horses in Southshore. She also wants 50 gold.
  accept 7645                         -- Merideth Carlson
  turnin 7645                         -- Manna-Enriched Horse Feed

step Dire Maul: Tendris Warpwood
  zone Feralas
  tip Dire Maul lies in central Feralas; Tendris Warpwood guards the start of the West wing. Defeat him to free the Ancient Equine Spirit, feed it the Manna-Enriched Horse Feed and hand it the Arcanite Barding to bless. Bring a group.
  goto 59.2,45.1 "Dire Maul"
  kill 11489 @59.2,45.1               -- Tendris Warpwood, inside the West wing
  turnin 7643 @59.2,45.1              -- Ancient Equine Spirit
  accept 7644 @59.2,45.1

step Lord Grayson Shadowbreaker
  zone Stormwind City
  turnin 7644                         -- Lord Grayson Shadowbreaker
  accept 7646

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Darkreaver

step Two diamonds
  tip An Azerothian Diamond comes from Thorium veins, a Pristine Black Diamond from the elites of the Western Plaguelands, both rarely: the Auction House is the usual source.
  collect 12800 quest 7646.1          -- Azerothian Diamond
  collect 18335 quest 7646.2          -- Pristine Black Diamond

step Lord Grayson Shadowbreaker
  zone Stormwind City
  turnin 7646                         -- Lord Grayson Shadowbreaker
  accept 7647                         -- he hands you the Divination Scryer

step The Great Ossuary
  zone Western Plaguelands
  tip Scholomance lies under Caer Darrow, the island town in the south-east of the Western Plaguelands. Use the Divination Scryer in the heart of the Great Ossuary's basement, defeat the spirits it calls and then Death Knight Darkreaver, and give his Fallen Charger the Charger's Redeemed Soul and the Blessed Arcanite Barding. All are elite: bring a group. If the attempt fails, Lord Grayson gives you a new scryer through Again Into the Great Ossuary.
  goto 69.7,73.2 "Scholomance"
  collect 18799 quest 7647.1 @69.7,73.2 -- Charger's Redeemed Soul: Death Knight Darkreaver
  turnin 7647 @69.7,73.2              -- Darkreaver's Fallen Charger
  learn 23214 "Summon Charger"
